#The project displayed on GitHub excludes:
#virtual environment files
#python bytecode
#sensitive information like testing history
#It also ignores system files and IDE configurations to keep the repository clean and focused on the essential code and resources.

# 1.Ignoring Python bytecode and cache files (common practice)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# 2. Ignoring virtual environment files (very important, can be very large)
venv/
.venv/
env/

# 3. Ignoring sensitive information (to prevent leaking API keys)
.env

# 4. Ignoring system files and IDE configuration
.DS_Store
.vscode/

# 5. Ignoring local indices or data that RAG projects might generate
data/
index_storage/
chroma_db/
chat_history/
history/
*.log